"'{0}' ຕ້ອງເປັນຂອງ abrt. ກະລຸນາແລ່ນຄຳສັ່ງ '# chown -R abrt.abrt {0}' ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ."

#. Was: "All downloaded packages have been extracted, removing..."
#. but it was appearing even if no packages were in fact extracted
